
WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Welcome to MedLink, a healthcare information exchange platform.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Doctors can search for patients and send diagnostic requests.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Radiologists review medical images and prepare reports.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Patients and doctors receive diagnostic results.
